46|[MsgBox]|Too fast? Play it again!`n`nYou can choose what commands you want to execute by unchecking the ones you don't want in the macro list.`n`nYou can also select to run only selected rows in [Macro > Playback options] and set a hotkey to play this macro step-by-step.`n`nThis was just a small demonstration`, PMC can do a lot more! Take some time to study the commands in this macro and learn what each one does.`n`nDownload more examples from the Help file in the [Tutorial] section and check out the video tutorials at https://www.macrocreator.com/help.`n`nWould like to see the videos now?`n|1|0|MsgBox|36||||96|
